  unitName: Swift Boxer Natasha (EU)
  unitId: 720257
  unitNumber: 7231
  description: "Natasha had always dreamed of joining Siegfried Academy. Being of
    a fearful nature, she admired the dragon hunters who were considered the paragon
    of strength and courage. It took one of her friends deciding to go to the Academy
    for Natasha to choose her destiny. She could\u2019ve chosen the medical unit
    like her friend, but she preferred the assault unit. After all, if she became
    strong, what would she have to fear in the future?"
  summonDesc: "My fists are the strongest! There\u2019s no reason to be afraid, right?"
  fusionDesc: "Everything\u2019s going to be fine... I\u2019m not scared... Just
    like during training\u2026"
  evoDesc: 
